feat: OCR spec extraction - separate item name and specification

- OCR prompt updated to split product name and spec (size/weight/packaging)
- shortName now shows "품목/규격" format (e.g., "코카콜라/1.5L")
- New spec field in OcrItem for standalone specification data
- Unit field now inferred from spec when available (e.g., "10kg" -> unit: "kg")
- Client UI: spec input field next to item name in purchase item cards

